  which was fine when NOCTALIA_SOURCE_ASSETS_DIR was the file's only output
  but would have left the git revision permanently stale across ordinary
  commits/checkouts once this second purpose was added. Cargo's documented
  default with zero rerun-if-* directives is "always rerun," which is what
  both purposes actually need (matches vcs_tag()'s own always-regenerate
  behavior) and doesn't change what NOCTALIA_SOURCE_ASSETS_DIR computes, only
  when it's recomputed. Verified end-to-end with a scratch example (deleted
